    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/62b4418ae9b54f7097b125789fce6889.avif?t=1754680292\" data-has-big width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your favorite songs and turn them into an electrifying, music-driven adventure! This innovative rhythm game transforms any track you import into a visually stunning, procedurally generated road where every beat shapes the challenge. Soar through vibrant landscapes, collect notes in sync with the music, and experience a fusion of sound, speed, and style like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/982700e6cdf576d4b0c9db0089cecab4.poster.avif?t=1754680292\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/982700e6cdf576d4b0c9db0089cecab4.webm?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/982700e6cdf576d4b0c9db0089cecab4.mp4?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Any Song\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Import your own music files, and let the game craft a unique level just for you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Music Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game detects beats, notes, and BPM to ensure precise rhythm-based gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Track Generation</strong> \u2013 Every song creates a one-of-a-kind road, adapting to its energy and volume dynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disco Lights &amp; Mesmerizing Effects</strong> \u2013 Experience pulsating neon visuals that react to the music, bringing every song to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete on  Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Climb the online leaderboards for any song and prove your rhythm mastery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Support</strong> \u2013 Create, share, and play custom tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013\u00a0Play through multiple distinct game modes that challenge your rhythm skills with gliding, platforming, and precision-timing mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/a0829bde32572809af46b6d2ecd0e5db.poster.avif?t=1754680292\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/a0829bde32572809af46b6d2ecd0e5db.webm?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/a0829bde32572809af46b6d2ecd0e5db.mp4?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/62b4418ae9b54f7097b125789fce6889.avif?t=1754680292\" data-has-big width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your favorite songs and turn them into an electrifying, music-driven adventure! This innovative rhythm game transforms any track you import into a visually stunning, procedurally generated road where every beat shapes the challenge. Soar through vibrant landscapes, collect notes in sync with the music, and experience a fusion of sound, speed, and style like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/982700e6cdf576d4b0c9db0089cecab4.poster.avif?t=1754680292\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/982700e6cdf576d4b0c9db0089cecab4.webm?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/982700e6cdf576d4b0c9db0089cecab4.mp4?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Any Song\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Import your own music files, and let the game craft a unique level just for you!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Music Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game detects beats, notes, and BPM to ensure precise rhythm-based gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Track Generation</strong> \u2013 Every song creates a one-of-a-kind road, adapting to its energy and volume dynamics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disco Lights &amp; Mesmerizing Effects</strong> \u2013 Experience pulsating neon visuals that react to the music, bringing every song to life.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete on  Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Climb the online leaderboards for any song and prove your rhythm mastery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor &amp; Steam Workshop Support</strong> \u2013 Create, share, and play custom tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013\u00a0Play through multiple distinct game modes that challenge your rhythm skills with gliding, platforming, and precision-timing mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/a0829bde32572809af46b6d2ecd0e5db.poster.avif?t=1754680292\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/a0829bde32572809af46b6d2ecd0e5db.webm?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372410/extras/a0829bde32572809af46b6d2ecd0e5db.mp4?t=1754680292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
